Sval: Remove about:protections

Sval never built about:protections, so its page, privacy metrics
service, images and strings shipped for nothing, and the protections
panel's dashboard button and Settings' dashboard link led to an error
page. ContentBlockingPrefs, which tracking protection's settings and
enterprise policy set their prefs through, stays.

